Date: Nov 18th, 2013
To: ASI WSI
Cc: SSC, CCB, CTY, CTS, ASG, WSG, DME
Fm: CCE

Re: [IRA] Notice of Dec 1st and Dec 15th RR Plan

It is very grateful that all RHQ and BB have done good job towards Nov 1st =
IRA RR.

But it is disappointing that Middle East Trade market rates are slumping sw=
iftly right after
Nov 1st RR was significantly applied bcoz of an extra-loader from non-IRA c=
arrier which
resulting in lacking of confidence to sustain post-RR rate level amongst me=
mber lines
although the healthy Blank sailing program are continuously steered by IRA =
members
individually to control the market capacity.

Thus, H/O would like to urge the necessity to call for another rounds of RR=
 plan in Dec.
Besides, more frequency to apply RR rather than only one big RR quantum for=
 every
month is another important factor to keep market rate level without sudden =
big decline.

As a result, HJS will take independent action to implement IRA RR on both D=
ec 1st and
Dec 15th with USD 200/T for each on a voluntary and non-binding basis, as b=
elow.

Scope

RR Quantum (USD)

Effective Date

20=92

40=92

Ex AOTJ to Middle East

USD 200

USD 400

Dec 1st 2013

USD 200

USD 400

Dec 15th 2013


At before, we may find out that customers have been smart enough to hold ca=
rgo during
the week when RR was scheduled to be applied, which directly lead to tempor=
ary market
volume shortage that finally causing market rate decreasing in an irrationa=
l/panic way. That=92s
why all member lines are determined to increase the RR frequency to apply t=
wo-phase RR in
whole Dec in order to restrain the customers=92 willingness to hold cargoes=
 to minimum level.

Moreover, blank sailing program will be on going to be in effect till week =
50 to make balance

Hence, under such circumstance, we strongly request both RHQ to strictly fo=
llow up with the
RR scheme and actively steer the RR program in Dec.

As usual, if any market deviation, pls share with us immediately and discus=
s with us for further
rate action internally before you taking any independent action.

# Attachment: IRA Blank Sailing (INTERNAL USE ONLY)

Tks for your cooperation!

B.rgds!

Andrew Hou

CCE
Tel : 02-3770-6707
Fax : 02-2287-3353
andrew@cn.hanjin.com<mailto:andrew@cn.hanjin.com>


